From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: matthane <matthan.evans@icloud.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 01:03:56 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] vdin: change the frame size of a running loopback stream

A loopback stream wrote every frame at its S_FMT size, so a consumer
that needed a larger image restarted it and every consumer lost about
one image. Its buffers could not move after STREAMON either, so larger
DMABUF buffers could not replace them.
